{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is a trial version of the full - scale game. You will have the opportunity to fully experience the following two game modes:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PVP: 36 - player battle;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ROOM: Create a room and battle with friends.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>As for the PVE mode, there will be 300 levels released in the official version, and only the first 5 levels can be experienced in this trial version.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761630/extras/1920.720_English.jpg?t=1748664413\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Large-scale same-screen battle: Experience large-scale online battles with 36 people on the same screen, with each player\u2019s strategies and actions clearly visible;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fair duel: We provide a fair competitive platform, allowing strength to be the only criterion for determining victory or defeat;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Room Mode: Create a room and have a friendly match with friends;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Video replay function: Automatically save your last 100 game videos for review and analysis at any time to improve your gaming skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3761630?t=1748664413","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761630/ba281efbb49acae7b7fabd57708875788abd64ad/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748664413","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3761630/c4a9a5ddfe4e8e07971690ebedce84d5dde51030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748664413","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3